  "validation": "Unity 2022.3.57f1c2 internal-display D3D11 isolated Play Mode passed: original bind/start/end ordering around deferred container Init; native single/multiple unlock events, duplicate subscription removal semantics, queued reveal, player/transfer/UI/native position branches, target notifications, and teardown. Acceptance calls the original Console visibility component and injects fixture visibility bytes only to exercise its branches; it does not define a new-game visibility policy. Formal map pointer flow, player/transfer host, full root prefab/map and Windows Player remain unverified.",
